          "x_evidence": "Jobber's G2 Ease of Setup score is approximately 8.9/10, compared to 6.7 for ServiceTitan. Reviews from 2025–2026 describe onboarding as 'straightforward' and 'intuitive.' One Trustpilot review (February 2026) says 'setup was easier than I expected.' A minority of users report thin onboarding support quality, but the consensus is low-to-moderate setup effort for small businesses. Scored on shipped surface.",
          "y_evidence": "Jobber ships CRM, quoting, scheduling, dispatch, invoicing, and online payments (online payments crossed 50% of all Jobber-processed transactions in Q3 2025). It syncs invoices and payments to QuickBooks Online or Xero. Marketing automation and consumer financing are not native features. Breadth is meaningful for core job workflow but narrower than Housecall Pro or ServiceTitan. Scored on shipped surface.",
