          "x_evidence": "Housecall Pro's G2 Ease of Setup score is approximately 8.8/10 from 124 reviews. Capterra's aggregated review summary says 'most reviewers describe ease of use as a major benefit, highlighting quick setup, accessible features, and minimal learning curve.' G2 comparison pages describe setup as more intuitive than ServiceTitan's. 94.7% of Housecall Pro reviewers on G2 are from companies with 50 or fewer employees, indicating the platform is calibrated for small-business operators. Scored on shipped surface.",
          "y_evidence": "Housecall Pro ships CRM, scheduling and dispatch, invoicing, payment processing (card processing at 2.59%, bank payments at 1%), marketing automation (automated SMS/email campaigns, review requests), consumer financing via Wisetack, and AI bookkeeping tools (Accountant AI, Fall 2025 release). Breadth exceeds Jobber's owing to native marketing and financing modules. Some advanced features (sales proposals, pipeline management) require add-on fees. Scored on shipped surface.",
