          "x_evidence": "Tessivane's stated value proposition centers on 'fast time-to-value: minimal setup and training overhead' and a UX designed for businesses without dedicated operations teams. It is shipping to paying customers. No independent complexity benchmarks exist; score reflects the founder's explicit positioning as the lowest-complexity option in the set, calibrated against the independently researched scores for Jobber and Housecall Pro (both 35–38), which are the acknowledged easy-to-use incumbents. Scored on shipped surface.",
